# DIAGNOSTICS

`unknown arch <name>; vx knows amd64, arm64, rv64` for any other word.
`<file> has no row in docs/risk.tsv: everything runs` for each changed file the map doesn't cover.
`vx test --check` prints `docs/risk.tsv:<line>: <path>: ` and the problem for each, then `vx: risk: <n> problems`.
A failed step prints `vx: <step> FAILED` and the tail of its log.
